WEBVTT

00:00:04.699 --> 00:00:05.825
(sniffing)

00:00:05.908 --> 00:00:06.909
(confused grunt)

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:08.995
-(siren hums seductively)
-(gasps)

00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:15.585
(kisses)

00:00:16.586 --> 00:00:17.629
(scoffs)

00:00:17.712 --> 00:00:19.047
(grumbling)

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:20.757
(siren whistles)

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.467
Aw, hey...

00:00:25.011 --> 00:00:26.262
(gasps)

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.598
(rapid grunting)

00:00:29.974 --> 00:00:31.351
(sighs)

00:00:33.353 --> 00:00:34.187
(grunting)

00:00:39.817 --> 00:00:43.071
(grunts quietly)

00:00:43.696 --> 00:00:44.947
(sirens growling)

00:00:45.031 --> 00:00:46.407
(hissing)

00:00:46.491 --> 00:00:48.368
(screaming, grunting)

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.121
(screaming)

00:00:58.044 --> 00:00:59.379
GRANNY: Here, girl!
来吧 姑娘

00:01:00.171 --> 00:01:02.674
Here, Precious!
宝宝 快过来

00:01:03.508 --> 00:01:05.259
She thinks she finally
found her pet.
她以为她终于找到宠物了

00:01:05.343 --> 00:01:06.344
(groans)
(laughs)

00:01:06.678 --> 00:01:07.845
Good girl.
乖孩子 来吃吧

00:01:07.929 --> 00:01:08.763
Here you go.
乖孩子 来吃吧

00:01:08.846 --> 00:01:10.473
Look, Granny,
can't you throw
听着 奶奶

00:01:10.556 --> 00:01:12.600
imaginary food to
your imaginary pet?
你能不能用想象的食物
来喂想象的宠物

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:16.729
(sighs)
Enough already!
你不要再闹了

00:01:17.271 --> 00:01:18.898
We need to keep a
lookout for home.
我们还要专心找家呢

00:01:18.981 --> 00:01:20.858
Ignore them, Precious.
别理他们 宝宝

00:01:21.359 --> 00:01:22.318
I do.
就像我

00:01:32.745 --> 00:01:34.288
Eh, you can't take your eyes
off her for one minute.
她真是一分钟都不让人省心

00:01:34.372 --> 00:01:36.124
Nope, it's like
having a child.
是啊 就像个小孩一样

00:01:36.207 --> 00:01:37.625
(grunts)

00:01:38.084 --> 00:01:39.669
Only without
any of the joy.
而且完全不能带来乐趣

00:01:39.752 --> 00:01:40.920
GRANNY: Hey, brain trust,
嘿 理性派 做好撞击准备

00:01:41.003 --> 00:01:42.296
brace for impact!
嘿 理性派 做好撞击准备

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:44.382
MANNY: Huh? Whoa!

00:01:44.465 --> 00:01:45.717
-(screams)
-(grunts)

00:01:47.719 --> 00:01:48.886
Guys, look!
伙计们 快看

00:01:49.303 --> 00:01:50.346
We're almost home!
我们快到家了

00:01:50.805 --> 00:01:52.014
Buddy, I never
doubted you.
伙计 我从不怀疑你

00:01:52.098 --> 00:01:52.932
Me, either.
我也是

00:01:53.266 --> 00:01:55.685
SID: Well, except for
the six or seven times
当然 除了那六七次
我以为快死了的时候

00:01:55.768 --> 00:01:57.145
I thought we were gonna die.
当然 除了那六七次
我以为快死了的时候

00:02:00.022 --> 00:02:01.941
(indistinct conversations)

00:02:06.404 --> 00:02:07.655
(sighs)

00:02:11.909 --> 00:02:12.744
(sighs)

00:02:12.827 --> 00:02:14.120
What's wrong, sweetheart?
怎么了 宝贝儿

00:02:14.203 --> 00:02:16.664
You ever say something you
knew you couldn't take back?
你有没有说过什么明知收不回来的话

00:02:16.748 --> 00:02:17.790
Is this about Louis?
是关于路易斯吗

00:02:18.166 --> 00:02:19.959
I messed up
so bad, Mom.
我真的搞砸了 妈妈

00:02:20.042 --> 00:02:21.753
It's okay. It happens.
没事的 总有这种时候

00:02:22.128 --> 00:02:24.422
Cute boys can whiplash
your brain.
帅哥就是会让你头脑发热
这点不用怀疑

00:02:24.505 --> 00:02:25.715
(chuckles):
No doubt about that.
帅哥就是会让你头脑发热
这点不用怀疑

00:02:26.048 --> 00:02:27.842
But Ethan was the wrong guy.
但是我看错了伊森

00:02:27.925 --> 00:02:28.968
And you figured it out.
而你也发现了

00:02:29.552 --> 00:02:31.012
You'll know what to say
to Louis.
你知道该对路易斯说什么的

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:34.015
(animals gasping, screaming)

00:02:34.098 --> 00:02:35.725
(animals murmuring)

00:02:37.268 --> 00:02:38.269
What's going on?
出了什么事

00:02:40.938 --> 00:02:41.898
(gasps)

00:02:44.567 --> 00:02:45.943
The land bridge.
是陆地桥

00:02:46.986 --> 00:02:47.862
It's gone.
它不见了

00:02:47.945 --> 00:02:49.155
(rumbling)

00:02:49.238 --> 00:02:50.072
(gasps)

00:02:51.741 --> 00:02:52.825
We're trapped!
无路可走了

00:02:55.536 --> 00:02:57.538
But we were supposed
to meet Dad here!
但我们说好在这里等爸爸的

00:02:57.622 --> 00:02:58.748
What are we gonna do?
现在我们怎么办

00:03:05.379 --> 00:03:07.089
-(thud)
-(yells)

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:13.054
Ellie!
艾莉

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:15.348
Peaches!
桃子

00:03:19.143 --> 00:03:20.186
DIEGO:
Oh, no.
哦不 陆地桥

00:03:20.269 --> 00:03:21.395
The land bridge.
哦不 陆地桥

00:03:21.479 --> 00:03:23.606
But if it's gone,
then how are we gonna...
可 如果它毁了 我们怎么

00:03:23.689 --> 00:03:24.857
-Sid.
-No!
希德 不

00:03:24.941 --> 00:03:26.192
They have to be
on the other side.
他们应该去了另一边

00:03:26.275 --> 00:03:28.319
Manny, there is
no other side.
曼尼 没有什么另一边了

00:03:28.402 --> 00:03:29.654
They have to be here!
她们一定在这里

00:03:29.737 --> 00:03:30.571
Ellie!
艾莉

00:03:31.322 --> 00:03:32.365
Peaches!
桃子

00:03:33.157 --> 00:03:34.450
MANNY: I'm here!
我在这儿

00:03:36.452 --> 00:03:39.372
Please, she's got to be here.
求求你 她应该在这儿

00:03:49.632 --> 00:03:50.675
PEACHES (in distance): Dad!
爸爸

00:03:50.758 --> 00:03:51.926
Wait, wait, did you hear that?
等等 你们听见了吗 曼尼

00:03:52.009 --> 00:03:53.594
-DIEGO: Manny...
-No, I-I heard something.
不 我听到什么了 我听到的

00:03:53.678 --> 00:03:54.512
I heard it!
不 我听到什么了 我听到的

00:03:57.515 --> 00:03:58.349
DIEGO:
Is that...
那不是

00:03:58.432 --> 00:03:59.725
Peaches? There she is!
桃子吗 就是她

00:04:00.476 --> 00:04:01.519
Dad!
爸爸

00:04:01.602 --> 00:04:02.728
We're coming, sweetie!
我们来了 宝贝 别走开

00:04:03.104 --> 00:04:04.063
Don't move!
我们来了 宝贝 别走开

00:04:04.146 --> 00:04:05.106
Daddy!
爸爸

00:04:05.189 --> 00:04:06.065
Peaches!
桃子

00:04:06.399 --> 00:04:07.441
(GUTT: evil laughter)

00:04:07.525 --> 00:04:09.110
Welcome home, Daddy.
欢迎回家 老爸

00:04:09.193 --> 00:04:10.111
Let go of me!
快放开我

00:04:10.194 --> 00:04:11.028
(gasps)
快放开我

00:04:11.112 --> 00:04:12.321
GUTT: What are the odds?
这也太巧了 我们刚刚才聊到你呢

00:04:12.697 --> 00:04:15.241
We were just
talking about you.
这也太巧了 我们刚刚才聊到你呢

00:04:15.324 --> 00:04:16.701
You like the new ship?
喜欢我的新船吗

00:04:17.034 --> 00:04:20.162
I call her Sweet Revenge.
我叫它 甜蜜复仇号

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.832
And look here.
你看这里 这是我们今天的收获

00:04:22.915 --> 00:04:25.042
We've got the catch du jour.
你看这里 这是我们今天的收获

00:04:25.126 --> 00:04:26.294
(grunting)
艾莉

00:04:26.377 --> 00:04:28.254
-Ellie!
-I'm all right.
我没事的

00:04:28.337 --> 00:04:29.171
-(grunts)
-(laughs)

00:04:29.255 --> 00:04:30.631
Let my daughter go.
把我女儿放了

00:04:30.715 --> 00:04:32.592
-(chuckles): Ooh.
-MANNY: It's okay.
没事的 他冲我来的

00:04:32.675 --> 00:04:33.801
He wants me.
没事的 他冲我来的

00:04:33.885 --> 00:04:35.219
And he's gonna get me.
我一定会让他如愿以偿

00:04:35.678 --> 00:04:36.554
Huh?

00:04:36.929 --> 00:04:38.764
(grunting weakly)

00:04:39.724 --> 00:04:42.351
Sacrificing yourself
for your daughter.
为了心爱的女儿而牺牲自己

00:04:42.435 --> 00:04:44.103
How touching.
多么感人

00:04:44.478 --> 00:04:45.688
How predictable.
多么没有创意

00:04:46.105 --> 00:04:47.982
Now come and get her.
那你就来救她吧

00:04:48.065 --> 00:04:49.191
(laughter)

00:04:52.486 --> 00:04:53.362
(laughter)

00:04:54.906 --> 00:04:55.990
G'day, mate.
你好啊 伙计

00:04:56.073 --> 00:04:57.283
You remember us?
还记得我们吗

00:04:57.366 --> 00:04:58.826
We're the bad guys.
我们就是坏人啊

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:01.412
All right, let them go.
好了 让她们走吧

00:05:01.495 --> 00:05:02.580
(chuckles)

00:05:02.663 --> 00:05:03.873
I don't think so.
这可不行

00:05:03.956 --> 00:05:06.459
You destroyed
everything I had.
你毁了我所拥有的一切

00:05:06.959 --> 00:05:09.295
I'm just returning the favor.
(gasps)
这个人情我要原样奉还

00:05:09.378 --> 00:05:10.212
No!
不

00:05:10.296 --> 00:05:11.881
(grunts)
不

00:05:11.964 --> 00:05:12.924
(Squint laughs)

00:05:13.007 --> 00:05:15.092
I warned you.
我警告过你的

00:05:15.176 --> 00:05:16.093
LOUIS: Stop!
住手

00:05:18.888 --> 00:05:21.432
Let the mammoth go!
把那个猛犸象放了

00:05:21.807 --> 00:05:22.642
Wiener?
小鼹

00:05:22.725 --> 00:05:23.768
(laughs)
小鼹

00:05:23.851 --> 00:05:24.852
Uh-oh.
这位猛男是谁带来的

00:05:24.936 --> 00:05:26.479
Who brought the muscle
to the party?
这位猛男是谁带来的

00:05:26.562 --> 00:05:27.688
Louis, don't!
路易斯 不要

00:05:27.772 --> 00:05:28.689
What's he doing?
他在干什么 他这样会丢掉性命的

00:05:28.773 --> 00:05:30.149
He's gonna get
himself killed.
他在干什么 他这样会丢掉性命的

00:05:30.232 --> 00:05:32.318
It's okay.
I can handle him.
没事的 我能搞定他

00:05:32.401 --> 00:05:33.653
How cute.
太可爱了 小英雄

00:05:33.736 --> 00:05:34.946
A hero.
太可爱了 小英雄

00:05:35.363 --> 00:05:37.531
Let's see what
bravery gets you.
我们来看看勇敢的代价吧

00:05:37.865 --> 00:05:38.699
-Gupta.
-Huh?
古塔 把武器给这小子

00:05:38.783 --> 00:05:40.117
Give the lad
your weapon.
古塔 把武器给这小子

00:05:41.369 --> 00:05:42.495
Nice knowing you, kid.
认识你很高兴 孩子

00:05:44.956 --> 00:05:46.874
(grunting)

00:05:49.001 --> 00:05:51.170
(laughter)

00:05:52.463 --> 00:05:53.339
Huh?

00:05:55.091 --> 00:05:57.301
Let's dance, hero.
来跳个舞吧 英雄

00:05:57.385 --> 00:05:58.886
(grunting)

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:00.346
Whoa.

